<title>USA: Baldwin Tech to sell Misomex to Kaber.</title>
<headline>Baldwin Tech to sell Misomex to Kaber.</headline>
<dateline>NORWALK, Conn. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Baldwin Technology Co Inc said Tuesday that it has signed an agreement to sell all the outstanding shares of the Misomex Group of Cos to privately-held Kaber Imaging Inc.</p>
<p>In a press release, the company said it expects to close the sale by June 30, 1997. Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Misomex, which manufactures pre-press equipment for the printing industry, has subsidiaries in England, Germany, Italy, Sweden and the United States.</p>
